    <mathmoddb:P1495 rdf:resource="https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265"/>
    <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">Although there were first attempts in the 1930s (first trajectory calculations for H+H2 reaction calculated by Polanyi in Berlin-Dahlem), this field has strongy evolved since the 1970s and 1980s with the upcoming of short laser pulses.</mathmoddb:P1459>
  </rdf:Description>
